---
title: "Rendering one page"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant F as Front controller
    participant S as FeedService
    participant C as Cache store
    participant N as Network
    participant P as FeedParser
    participant R as Renderer

    B->>F: GET /demos/one-line
    F->>S: render(RenderRequest)
    S->>S: resolveCategory() — unknown names fall back, never error
    loop each subscribed feed, in position order
        S->>C: get(url)
        alt cached and still inside its interval
            C-->>S: body
        else expired, or nothing cached
            S->>N: conditional GET (ETag / If-Modified-Since)
            alt 304 Not Modified
                N-->>S: 304 — keep the body, bump the timestamp
            else 200
                N-->>S: new body — store it
            else failure
                N-->>S: error — serve the stale copy if there is one
            end
        end
        S->>P: parse(body)
        alt will not parse
            P-->>S: throws
            Note over S,C: A fresh-looking but damaged entry is<br/>discarded and refetched exactly once
        else
            P-->>S: Channel + Items
        end
    end
    S->>R: render(category, feeds, request)
    R->>R: substitute tokens, escape once, sanitise item bodies
    R-->>F: HTML
    F-->>B: 200 with the hardening headers
